# Profile 'proot': Android distro rootfs (DroidDeck, proot-distro), all but desktop integration.
#
# One glob per line, relative to the repo root; '*' also matches '/'.
# Unlike root/work this is "everything, minus": '!GLOB' lines exclude, so new
# files in the repo reach a PRoot clone without editing this list.
# The desktop there is the vendor's (DroidDeck: patched KDE/kwin), which owns
# its GTK theme, MIME defaults and portals; ours would fight it, and KDE
# writes through the symlinks into the repo. systemd user units stay linked:
# without systemd they are inert files.
# See docs/linking-system.md (Profiles) and docs/setup/droiddeck.md.

*

# {{{ - Desktop integration owned by the vendor session ------------------------
!home/.config/mimeapps.list
!home/.gtkrc-2.0
!home/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini
!home/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini
!home/.config/xdg-desktop-portal/portals.conf
# }}} - Desktop integration owned by the vendor session ------------------------
